{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_harold_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_harold_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"老兵的義肢","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_harold_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"961a25e2b0e65e2d928911537197e714e7a80d4d3c0996ec7055eaaaadb52415","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"某日，哈洛德的義肢被馱獸踩壞了。為了修好義肢，哈洛德決定尋求羅德島的幫助……","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g11_snowylane"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里斯本那個混帳，把我們叫來幫忙放牧，自己不知道跟女生跑去哪裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你說，里斯本不會真的打算在謝拉格成家吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前不是慫恿得最厲害嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在開始擔心兄弟真的成家了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是擔心他被騙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝拉格人這麼淳樸，我們騙他們還差不多，還他們騙里斯本，省省吧，你這傢伙就是嫉妒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話可不能這麼說，我們是士兵，保家衛國是我們的天職，被騙進溫柔鄉難道不也是一種騙嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你下次述職的時候也能這麼大聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你下次述職的時候嘴巴也能這麼毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放你的牧去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，在這裡放牧一輩子，總比回去打仗強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有這種好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定呢，前幾天老大收到了公爵閣下的來信，雖然不知道信上寫了什麼，但老大這幾天可是一直在說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，我看他每天說的還是他的寶貝馱獸。看——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，好孩子，放鬆，放鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫順的馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（虛弱的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，就是這樣，好孩子，不會痛的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫順的馱獸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（吃痛的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，蘭蘭，別緊張，別怕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"吃痛的馱獸向哈洛德的方向邁了兩步，正在安撫馱獸的哈洛德連忙躲閃，卻還是慢了一步。\n“喀啦”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊喔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他低頭看去，看到的是義肢的殘骸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陰沉的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_414_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傑克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……抱歉，老大，我知道您肯定要叫我去醫院跑腿，能不能讓我先笑完？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實是要讓你跑腿，不過我要你跑的不是醫院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在剛來的時候就調查過了，謝拉格的醫院沒有能幫我修義肢的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能幫我修的，恐怕只有羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島……但是，那邊跟我們關係不太好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因為關係不好，所以才要去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是你們不用回去打仗，我不用回去應付那些貴族的最後機會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？那我立刻就去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g9_manoravenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德先生，我們請工程部的同事看了一下您的義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"它在被踩碎前內部結構就已經瀕臨崩潰了，不然的話，馱獸雖然很重，卻也不至於把它踩壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟在那之前，它可是面對了比馱獸強大百倍的存在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位專家怎麼看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡有一個好消息和一個壞消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您先說好消息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息是，羅德島剛引進的新設備，確實可以維修您的義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我猜，壞消息恐怕是，沒有材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不，羅德島和喀蘭貿易的合約中包含了這種材料的交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼……是缺乏人手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，是的，您的義肢採用的技術過於先進，派駐謝拉格的幹員裡沒有掌握這種技術的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那真是遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，看來時隔多年，我的手杖又要發揮它本來的作用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，有一位本艦工程部的幹員現在正在謝拉格旅遊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"不過她正在休假中，來到謝拉格後並沒有和辦事處這邊接觸，所以我們也不清楚她的具體行程安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能聯絡上她，或許可以請她幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我去找吧。有什麼線索嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……訊使先生之前提到過他為她的同伴送了些貨物，或許他知道些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"訊使，魏斯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這倒是給我出了個難題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"您要是不方便的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，讓我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，您的腿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我拄手杖的時間，可不比裝義肢的時間要短。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_088","isRemote":false,"text":"銀灰先生，我按照你的要求告訴他了，他確實自己去了，這樣就可以了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我和博士聊過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然他想借這個機會接近羅德島，那麼，我們不過是做些順水推舟的事情罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德不會不知道這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恩希歐迪斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的，就看他自己了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生，你今天也來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，過一陣子我要跟老爺去羅德島待一段時間，最近就打算多來這邊幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"車站員工","speakerId":"avg_npc_273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，有一位老先生在這邊等你很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生，好久不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子爵閣下，久疏問候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為您已經離開謝拉格了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，魏斯先生說笑了，我的一舉一動不都在您的視線範圍內嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不會不知道，老爺早把監視給撤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也樂得清閒，至少不用擔心被人敲悶棍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生性情直爽，我不討厭和您這樣的人打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，您有什麼事竟然需要來找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣的，我正在尋找一名羅德島工匠大師，想請她幫我修理我的義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說您知道她在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我大概知道您說的是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然，我也不打算輕易從您的口中得到情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經和車站的人商量過了，只要我的義肢能夠修好，我就來協助您送信，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不能輕易地把羅德島幹員的情報透露給一個維多利亞軍人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，果然沒那麼輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的話，怕是只能讓傑克他們跑一跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不行，現在讓他們露面，只會引起誤解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德&憂鬱的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這位女士，發生了什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……沒什麼，就是工作壓力太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺我快要撐不住了，但是，我又不能失去這份工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生總是身不由己，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是個難得的假期，但是，我平時幾乎沒有娛樂，就算放假了也只能像個傻瓜一樣坐在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的生活有什麼樂趣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，你對舞蹈感興趣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"普普通通吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你有興趣欣賞一個殘疾人的舞蹈嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？但是，你的腿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說斷了一條腿就不能跳舞了呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈洛德不再說話，只是拄著手杖，來到女孩面前，向她行了一個紳士禮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著女孩的驚呼，哈洛德揮舞著手杖開始了舞蹈。\n他先是圍繞著手杖，跳出輕盈的舞步。\n手杖與皮鞋不時與地面敲擊，發出有節奏的聲響，與周邊店鋪中播放的音樂完美融合。\n不僅如此，到高潮處，他還將手杖向上扔起，手杖在空中旋轉，然後被他穩穩接住，如同雜技一般引得女孩連連喝彩。\n女孩也受到了哈洛德的感染，站起來加入了他，和他一起舞動了起來。\n不知不覺間，周圍的路人都被哈洛德吸引過來，有的欣賞，有的乾脆加入了他們。\n一時間，廣場上變得熱鬧不已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與其猶豫，不如加入，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說得對！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨著音樂漸停，哈洛德打算用一個華麗的拋手杖作為謝幕。\n然而——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g14_skyovercast_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"也許是生疏了，又或者是被熱鬧的氛圍沖昏了頭腦，在最後，他的手不慎滑了一下。\n手杖在空中劃出了一道美麗的弧線，然而，它卻向著一個哈洛德一時間無法夠到的位置落去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼看這場秀要以一個慘澹的失敗作為落幕，一道身影如閃電般劃過，在半空中輕輕撞了一下手杖。\n手杖立刻改變了軌道，並穩穩地落入了哈洛德手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"45_g6_lakescenery_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈洛德順勢向周圍行了一個禮，作為演出的謝幕。\n一時間，掌聲雷動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也可以變成您這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼要變成我這樣呢，女士，你有健全的雙腿、美麗的容顏、充足的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定可以變得比我更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再憂鬱的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_280_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我會試試看，謝謝您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能讓你這樣的年輕人獲得一些勇氣是我的榮幸，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及……鐧女士，您看了多久了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在附近吃飯，正好看到而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跳得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，為了進入社交場，不得不做了些努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些貴族喜歡拿我的腿開玩笑，我就乾脆向我夫人好好學習了一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，老哈洛德在舞蹈上有一“腿”也算是我小小的招牌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腿怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，義肢因公殉職，原因嘛，想必您不會不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……居然扛到了現在，品質不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒辦法修？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有一位羅德島的技術專家修得了，不過魏斯先生不願意為我帶路，這不就只能在這裡唉聲嘆氣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你唉聲嘆氣的是找不到工匠，還是搭不上羅德島的關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……鐧女士，您要是踏入社交場，一定是個可怕的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，既然你看起來很閑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科倫多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，老大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午你爹那邊播種不是缺人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和角峰說一聲，這位維多利亞老兵要去幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等，角峰……這或許確實是個突破口。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（況且，這位也是遲早要面對的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鐧","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你去不去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我不得不重複一下剛才的那句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧女士，您要是踏入社交場，一定是個可怕的存在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"鐧說老爺找她，她抽不開身，所以讓這位過來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"強壯的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久疏問候，角峰先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"別的我就不多問了，你會種田嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我有空的時候都會親自去領地裡的耕地幫忙種田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"田野是老哈洛德最要好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不過，角峰先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果要去田裡的話，那這支手杖是不是有點太礙事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想跟你拿一些東西，來做一副簡易的義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些木頭，一把小刀，一些棉花，一根繩子，就這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"就這些就可以做一副義肢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"角峰覺得有點不可思議，但哈洛德一臉理所當然地開始動作。\n他先挑了一塊圓柱狀的細木頭，比較了一下自己斷肢的長度，然後把木頭兩端削平，用來當作義肢的“腿”。\n然後，他又挑了一塊圓形的扁平木頭，在中間挖了個洞，將“腿”嵌入其中。一個簡單到不能更簡單的“義肢”雛形就算完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"你有這樣做過義肢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然軍隊也會分配義肢，但是戰場形勢瞬息萬變，一旦義肢出問題，誰有那麼多功夫去修。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候，這種簡單卻又實用的義肢至少可以不拖累行軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，義肢的價格可不便宜，尤其是軍人，對義肢的要求更高。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈洛德一邊說著，一邊繼續把一塊木頭削成碗的形狀，然後用棉花把裡面填滿。\n他接著將腿塞入碗中，用繩子把碗和義肢綁在一起，最後再打一個死結。\n他站起來走了兩步，轉了一圈，再向角峰行了個禮，表示大功告成。\n這個畫面有點搞笑，不過角峰卻忍不住為他拍了兩下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我還有一副這樣的自製義肢放在家鄉，要去田裡工作的時候，我就會用那副義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，我平時用的那副可是狠下心花了大錢買的。它倒也算是對得起那個價格，這些年都沒出過什麼大問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我常和我的手下們開玩笑說，在戰場上如果出事了，先救我的義肢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟它的價格快要超過我的撫卹金了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"……呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"你的家鄉……也都是田野嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，跟謝拉格不一樣，那裡的田野是金色的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，有些東西是一樣的，你不覺得嗎，角峰先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕陽西下，哈洛德、角峰，還有農民們站在田埂間看著他們一個下午的成果，都忍不住長嘆了一口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做這種事總是很有成就感，對不對，角峰先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"當然……我只是沒想到，像你這樣的維多利亞貴族，也會和我有一樣的感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，可不要因為這樣對維多利亞貴族產生不切實際的期待，你會失望的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼會是維多利亞貴族？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個好問題，角峰先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像每個開斯特家族的人都在哀怨，為什麼恩希歐迪斯老爺是謝拉格人一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們終究無法解釋這些問題，最後，只能歸咎於命運的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"角峰先生，下次恩希歐迪斯老爺路過我們郡的時候，請一定要來和我打一聲招呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會請我的夫人親自下廚，為你們做一頓維多利亞家常菜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，你可以和恩希歐迪斯老爺一起在那裡住一段時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候，我就可以讓你們聽一聽我家鄉的歌謠——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"哈洛德說著，輕輕哼起了屬於他家鄉的歌謠。\n旁邊的幾個農民聽到哈洛德哼的歌謠後，也忍不住哼起了謝拉格的民謠。\n不知不覺間，就變成了你一首維多利亞歌謠，我一首謝拉格民謠的田野歌唱大會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天這麼熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯，你又來送信啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這歌有點耳熟，但好像又不太一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個維多利亞老頭也在跟我們一起唱啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唱得還真好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞老頭？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏斯順著歌聲看去，只見哈洛德在為一位正在高聲歌唱的鄉親打拍子。\n他的神情變幻了幾下，最終歸於平淡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯那裡，我會幫你說兩句，但我沒辦法保證他會聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"他的個性如此，希望你能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和我年輕的時候比，算是很好相處了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"看來不用我幫忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您早知道結局是那樣，一開始又何必裝模作樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯先生，士兵從來沒有問心無愧以及請求被害者原諒的資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我只能這麼說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實很喜歡謝拉格這片土地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以的話，我希望它能好好的。未來，我想和我的家人一起再來這裡看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我正好順路，要去幫那位工匠小姐送貨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏斯","speakerId":"avg_198_blackd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟得上的話就跟上來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"魏斯說完轉身就走。\n但他並沒有發揮他敏捷的身手，幾下就跳到遠處，只是用比常人稍微快一些的步行速度向著雪山的方向走去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"魏斯他也很苦惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是人都會苦惱吧，角峰先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老哈洛德也很苦惱。只是，就像我斷肢的地方時不時會隱隱作痛一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少告訴別人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒有人在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，再見，角峰先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等一下，哈洛德先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺剛剛傳訊息給我，他說過幾天要舉辦一場晚宴，想要邀請你出席，我和魏斯，還有鐧也會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我欠了人情的不只是鐧女士，還有恩希歐迪斯老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（原本只是想藉這個機會和羅德島建立關係，但現在看來，我就算明天遞交入職申請大概都沒什麼問題了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（那位大師的去向是你的手筆，對不對，恩希歐迪斯老爺？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，也不能這麼說。只是我們想的一樣，我去羅德島，對你、對我、對謝拉格、對開斯特，都好。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"char_199_yak","isRemote":false,"text":"哈洛德先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈洛德","speakerId":"avg_4114_harold_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請轉告恩希歐迪斯老爺，老哈洛德到時候一定帶上好酒，我們不醉不歸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_199_yak","aliases":["角峰"]}]}
